# Run in a nested lit by ../../deps.test: %{msil_prog_O2} of one source with
# a native library argument for both builds (%{msil_native_libs}) and two
# files that every run gets beside the program (%{msil_deps}), one chosen by
# lit's %if and one named by a wildcard, which lit's shell expands.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && split-file %s %t
# REDEFINE: %{msil_srcs} = %t/main.c
# REDEFINE: %{msil_native_libs} = -Wl,--stand-in-native
# REDEFINE: %{msil_deps} = %if msil-triple-windows %{ %t/dep-a.txt %} %else %{ %t/dep-a.txt %} %t/more/*
# RUN: %{msil_prog_O2}
#--- main.c
// prog-value: 5
#--- dep-a.txt
A file every run gets beside the program.
#--- more/dep-b.txt
Another one.
